DTSTART:20270202T123000Z
DTEND:20270202T130000Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 13:00 GMT: Gasworks Residency 2027 for Artists Based in th
 e Baltics (London\, with Upe Foundation\; solo show 2028)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 02 Feb 2027 at 13:00 GMT.\n\nGasworks and the Upe Founda
 tion offer a fully funded eleven-week London residency for one contemporar
 y visual artist at a pivotal stage in their career who is based in Lithuan
 ia\, Latvia or Estonia\, as part of a multi-year partnership for artists a
 nd curators connected to the Baltic region.\n\nOrganisation: Gasworks (Lon
 don)\, with Upe Foundation\nLocation: London\, UK. For contemporary visual
  artists based in Lithuania\, Latvia or Estonia.\nAward: Fully funded 11-w
 eek residency: weekly stipend of GBP 175\, materials budget up to GBP 800\
 , private studio\, accommodation\, economy return flights and transfers\, 
 all visa costs\, plus a solo exhibition at Gasworks in 2028. No applicatio
